Task detail page had two bugs: (1) raw <tool_call> XML shown as plain text — now uses shared renderContent() from $lib/formatMessage.ts which handles tool calls (collapsible details), <think> blocks, markdown, and @mentions. Extracted from conversation page so both share the same renderer. (2) scrollToBottom() called on every 3s poll, resetting user's scroll position — now only scrolls on initial load or when message count actually changes. Separated poll() from load() for this.
